      "widgets_values": [
        "## W5_07 Character sheet\n\n- Only input: **one person photo** (image_1). Full body, front-facing, plain background works best.\n- The sheet layout (5 panels, headers, form lines, rulers) comes from the prompt; no layout image is used.\n- Output size: 2560x1440 (16:9).\n- Students change only the photo.\n\nLimits: BACK and PROFILE views are invented by the model from one photo. Panel count, header text and ruler marks can come out wrong. Check every panel.\n\nPaid API node: one run per approval."
      ],
      "title": "READ ME",
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    }
